  "notes": "A voucher or ticket that entitles the holder to a price reduction. Commonly distributed by stores, restaurants, and online retailers.\n\nETYMOLOGY:\nCompound of {割引|わりびき} (discount) + {券|けん} (ticket/voucher).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {割引券|わりびきけん}を{使|つか}う: to use a coupon\n- {割引券|わりびきけん}をもらう: to receive a coupon\n- {割引券|わりびきけん}を{配|くば}る: to hand out coupons\n- {有効期限|ゆうこうきげん}: expiration date\n\nFORMS:\n- クーポン: coupon (loanword, increasingly common)\n- {割引|わりびき}チケット: discount ticket\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {割引|わりびき}: discount\n- {半額|はんがく}: half price\n- {商品券|しょうひんけん}: gift certificate",
